 271:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         @note
 272:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         This function will issue a NAK packet on any OUT packet received on
 273:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         USB endpoint until exiting this function. If you exit this function
 274:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         before transfer is complete on CDC interface (ie. using DMA controller)
 275:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         it will result in receiving more data while previous ones are still
 276:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *         not sent.
 277:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   *
 278:USB_Device/App/usbd_cdc_if.c ****   * @param  Buf: Buffer of data to be received
